@startuml UNS_北向信息流时序图

title UNS 上行（北向）信息流时序图 - 从设备到企业应用

participant "设备层\n(PLC/传感器)" as Device
participant "边缘网关\n(Edge Gateway)" as Edge
participant "MQTT Broker\n(EMQX)" as Broker
participant "桥接器\n(Bridge)" as Bridge
participant "Schema Registry" as Schema
participant "Kafka集群" as Kafka
participant "企业应用\n(MES/EMS/BI/AI)" as Enterprise

' === 设备上线注册流程 ===
group 设备上线注册 [Sparkplug B Birth 机制]
    Device -> Edge: 设备连接/上电
    Edge -> Broker: NBIRTH(节点上线)\nspBv1.0/ACME/NBIRTH/Gateway01
    Broker -> Bridge: 订阅NBIRTH消息
    Bridge -> Schema: 获取节点Schema\nGET /subjects/gateway-node/versions/latest
    Schema --> Bridge: 返回Avro Schema
    Bridge -> Bridge: 验证并转换NBIRTH数据
    
    Edge -> Broker: DBIRTH(设备上线)\nspBv1.0/ACME/DBIRTH/Gateway01/Motor01
    Broker -> Bridge: 订阅DBIRTH消息
    Bridge -> Schema: 获取设备Schema\nGET /subjects/motor-metric/versions/latest
    Schema --> Bridge: 返回Avro Schema
    Bridge -> Bridge: 验证并转换DBIRTH数据
    Bridge -> Kafka: 发布设备注册事件\nuns.device.registry
end

' === 实时数据上报流程 ===
group 实时数据采集与上报 [周期性/事件驱动]
    loop 每 100ms-1s
        Device -> Edge: 读取实时数据\n(OPC UA/Modbus)
        Edge -> Edge: 数据预处理与缓存
        Edge -> Broker: DDATA(设备数据)\nspBv1.0/ACME/DDATA/Gateway01/Motor01\nQoS=1
        note right Edge: 包含: Speed, Temperature,\nTimestamp, Quality
    end
    
    Broker -> Bridge: 订阅DDATA消息
    Bridge -> Bridge: 解析Sparkplug Payload
    Bridge -> Schema: 验证数据Schema\nPOST /compatibility/subjects/motor-metric/versions/latest
    Schema --> Bridge: Schema验证通过
    Bridge -> Bridge: Sparkplug → Avro转换
    Bridge -> Kafka: 发布Avro格式数据\nuns.device.metric\nKey: Motor01
    note right Bridge: 二进制Avro格式\n包含: deviceId, metricName,\nvalue, timestamp, quality
    
    Kafka -> Enterprise: 消费者组订阅数据
    Enterprise -> Enterprise: 业务处理\n(实时监控/分析/告警)
end

' === 数据质量监控 ===
group 数据质量与状态监控
    Edge -> Broker: DDEATH(设备离线)\nspBv1.0/ACME/DDEATH/Gateway01/Motor01
    Broker -> Bridge: 订阅DDEATH消息
    Bridge -> Kafka: 发布设备离线事件\nuns.device.status
    Kafka -> Enterprise: 设备状态更新
end

@enduml